t":168,"text":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。","contentHash":"sha256:ef72150af6a5338c5c311f9ab7b9701fe026dc012a588882231f590c90a519d2"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":2651,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-0817023bbaaf399e86e9e3d7ddd9877fdfe793b96c54e87f39ec570c8f317614","documentVersion":"sha256:350b8c4603e2cb087d61f8fc7dd1ce9afb98a2980112eae389917e7befdaabda","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":310,"text":"填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","contentHash":"sha256:a4cf81da0e2e3a7af1307dad29cb9dac10473c045bfc4c1c7b788dfbc89f5bc5"}},{"document":{"id":"reference-vs-rules-v1","title":"图鉴资料、版本与比赛规则的区别","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"版本 规则 合法性 资料 来源 图鉴 pokeapi 排位 最新 强势","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["reference"]}},"score":2310,"checksum":"sha256:80eab54b4416ed9ee323fbee2efb79e3225dae0a5efa7cd4f8079d369e6fd46b","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-e2992d691aac2ee5897c1264d3f178b9b8bd443cc16b544708e983c68543afcc","documentVersion":"sha256:f4f8a628ee878c8ff6fb7f0fdc547b02ca6203c0e2a2a4e0b6a719fa1bbc0430","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":218,"text":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","contentHash":"sha256:646ecf409f2ddb19c067dd0978eb3aecf62924e395a81f58848a83780baaa163"}}]], ToolResponse[id=call_01_dHJ0dZFDXuQkFDDijngm3004, name=searchPokemonGuides, responseData=[{"document":{"id":"team-roles-v1","title":"围绕核心成员构建队伍","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"组队 阵容 搭配 联防 核心 角色 team building synergy","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"","content":"这是项目原创的通用策略笔记，不是当前热门阵容榜单。先确定游戏、单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["team"]}},"score":5732,"checksum":"sha256:d78df7b3057e37e45bd10f63c0717f137f69def81a87e9c50ddb98a50d125482","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-7b5d79406a813124afcf96c38f0256703c66f1eb11396c928a27f095926d3d7e","documentVersion":"sha256:08038b577a4e4bdbb2345f21c9b698a906422fbf175b66f993e1f43481c02aa9","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":195,"text":"这是项目原创的通用策略笔记，不是当前热门阵容榜单。先确定游戏、单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"field-settings-and-unsupported-v1","title":"天气场地与尚未接入的计算条件","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"天气 场地 单打 双打 太晶 强化 墙 异常 入场 计算 条件","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本地计算桥接会把单打或双打、天气与场地交给伤害引擎，但不会因此自动模拟完整战局。项目接收Singles或Doubles；天气与场地必须是接口允许的名称。没有提供的天气或场地会以空值回读，结果解读应保留这种状态，不能补说为某个特定天气已经生效。对不同条件做比较时，每一组都应分别调用工具，并确认其他配置一致。\n\n当前桥接没有表达能力强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害或太晶条件，结果还以满HP为假设。即使上游引擎拥有更多能力，也不能把尚未接入的输入说成项目已经计算。用户要求这些情况时，应指出接口缺失，避免给出假装精确的结果。已选择Doubles也不代表完成了整支双打队伍的协同模拟；该请求仍是指定攻防双方与招式的伤害计算。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":1856,"checksum":"sha256:5a12eb90d90013676a85eab1da25d615d9c0b7266eed5f6254f97523c5f7f99e","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-4a29fbc347cd8dcfa835b0f68ce7aecea65d974c4a413416c6c356117f54d54c","documentVersion":"sha256:7f5b7aca76946eb8ab06148cbccaa55bb16e7cf0c1aa68acf6a294ce9a0b1171","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":155,"endOffset":308,"text":"当前桥接没有表达能力强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害或太晶条件，结果还以满HP为假设。即使上游引擎拥有更多能力，也不能把尚未接入的输入说成项目已经计算。用户要求这些情况时，应指出接口缺失，避免给出假装精确的结果。已选择Doubles也不代表完成了整支双打队伍的协同模拟；该请求仍是指定攻防双方与招式的伤害计算。","contentHash":"sha256:702fc319d3dad32728e618b757444ce47544293981a3b915814d2d75a3d32115"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-request-checklist-v1","title":"发起伤害计算前要补齐什么","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 条件 攻击方 防守方 对手 清单 输入 问诊","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。\n\n建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":1320,"checksum":"sha256:bd79ff5a9c99bc64643b994b76d26c5d211729600ac90fa3b3132cf3628d94d4","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-31321f7580ac3c751942d9cf3430417430241bbd38e921e8795eb64442cc4d83","documentVersion":"sha256:604a2524e320f0d16e72cd129d9e2c64fcdbdc0b08e93a96f3440959b762f026","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":133,"text":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。","contentHash":"sha256:6ab5af4c458922fc236120308379f43e89d51ca5851d00dcae346356a70c9534"}},{"document":{"id":"status-moves-and-output-v1","title":"变化招式、伤害区间与击倒判断","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"变化招式 辅助 招式 威力 区间 百分比 击倒 秒杀 胜率 Status","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本地伤害桥接遇到引擎分类为Status的变化招式时，会拒绝生成直接伤害区间。这不表示该招式没有战术价值，只表示当前请求不能用直接伤害数值回答。用户想比较控制、回复或其他非直接伤害效果时，需要相应机制资料及对局条件；不能把伤害接口的拒绝解释成该招式无用，也不能虚构一个伤害百分比。\n\n对能计算的攻击招式，结果包括最小和最大伤害、目标满HP与对应百分比。解读时应同时保留范围和假设，而不是只挑最大值宣称稳定击倒。区间不等于胜率，单次对局计算也不证明整队强度。遇到工具失败、未知名称或未支持条件时，应分别指出失败原因，并说明哪部分结论尚无数值依据。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage","resource"]}},"score":1039,"checksum":"sha256:0fe8e773449f2cfe4f1435b603b94eea0715b8ae60636621be517b07c87210d5","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-281229d960fab68b8dc1f93bd2dfbbd37b322c38e46174dcbd7f667836b05d2e","documentVersion":"sha256:d648a36f7db97d2bf4881cdb580781320b947b145b778d982f1f2469e97eacd9","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":141,"endOffset":271,"text":"对能计算的攻击招式，结果包括最小和最大伤害、目标满HP与对应百分比。解读时应同时保留范围和假设，而不是只挑最大值宣称稳定击倒。区间不等于胜率，单次对局计算也不证明整队强度。遇到工具失败、未知名称或未支持条件时，应分别指出失败原因，并说明哪部分结论尚无数值依据。","contentHash":"sha256:5f92e40199d254542a63d07330ecdb89e4b409ad7c3d0b82910bfbab761ba934"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@7ed13794}
